# ===========================================
# Release notes (per-tag, not cumulative)
# ===========================================
# Each release's change log lives on its GitHub Release page -- one body
# per tag, scoped to that release only. A cumulative RELEASE-NOTES.md is
# the wrong shape (release notes belong to a specific tag, not an
# ever-growing file). Untracked 2026-05-27; local copy retained.
RELEASE-NOTES.md

