# Maintainer build tools for #179: build_hermes_install.py reads a DEV
# DB dump + sanitization manifest and emits config/database/hermes_install.sql
# (the canonical fresh-install schema). Operators don't run these --
# they consume the resulting committed .sql. Kept locally for the
# maintainer; untracked so they don't ship with the operator-facing tree.
scripts/build_hermes_install.py
scripts/hermes_install_manifest.yaml

